WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.517
Rachel: What are you cooking, Mom?

2
00:00:22.518 --> 00:00:25.148
Mom: I'm making applesauce.

3
00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:27.070
Ricky: Can we help?

4
00:00:27.071 --> 00:00:29.096
Mom: Sure!

5
00:00:29.097 --> 00:00:34.075
Rachel: How do you make applesauce?

6
00:00:34.076 --> 00:00:37.522
Mom: First, we peel 12 apples.

7
00:00:37.523 --> 00:00:40.941
Ricky: Twelve?

8
00:00:40.942 --> 00:00:46.762
Mom: Then, we slice the apples.

9
00:00:46.763 --> 00:00:49.626
Ricky: Can I help cut the apples?

10
00:00:49.627 --> 00:00:51.507
Rachel: Me too!

11
00:00:51.508 --> 00:01:01.675
Mom: Yes, but be careful with the knife.

12
00:01:01.676 --> 00:01:06.342
Ricky: Look, Mom! I have red hair.

13
00:01:06.343 --> 00:01:13.750
Mom: Ricky! Put the peels in the garbage.

14
00:01:13.751 --> 00:01:16.590
Rachel: Are we finished?

15
00:01:16.591 --> 00:01:27.517
Mom: Not yet. It takes thirty minutes.

16
00:01:27.518 --> 00:01:33.023
Ricky: Mmm! Smells delicious!

17
00:01:33.024 --> 00:01:45.345
Mom: Now we mix the apples and sugar.

18
00:01:45.346 --> 00:01:52.469
Rachel: It looks strange, Mom.

19
00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:57.678
Ricky: It's h-h-hot!

20
00:01:57.679 --> 00:02:05.351
Mom: Put the applesauce into the jars.

21
00:02:05.352 --> 00:02:11.710
Ricky: Making applesauce is fun.
